WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.180
To resolve audio copyright issues,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.520
US creators can now generate instrumental tracks

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.360
right in the YouTube Studio editor.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.060
The Replace Song tool in YouTube Studio Desktop

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.140
will now include a new Create button.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.500
Hit it and YouTube will generate

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.700
four royalty-free instrumental tracks

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.140
that you can use to replace copyrighted audio

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.140
in your videos and release Content ID claims.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.520
That's US and desktop only for now.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.400
Global launch and Studio Mobile come later in 2026.

